{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:602ff511a79bea0f","name":"Black-Powder Pistol","source":{"id":"source:reference-602ff511a79bea0f","title":"Black-Powder Pistol","revision":16240,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:33Z","sha256":"a0566c4e8b1c951f897a889b3a3aa313a732d71750667133fec59795258cb00b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16240","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Black-Powder%20Pistol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-602ff511a79bea0f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Black-Powder Pistol's usage or possession is rarely regulated, because it is considered antique on most worlds. Although reloading the weapon is slow and the weapon has a limited ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", its main benefit is that knowledgeable explorers can usually scrounge together the materials to produce ammunition no matter where in the galaxy they might be. Black-Powder Pistols are notoriously finicky and require frequent maintenance. Many a spacer forced to use an ill-kept Black Powder Pistol has had it literally fizzle on him or her. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Black-Powder Pistol must be reloaded after each shot and requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," to reload, preventing the use of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that allow multiple shots. Ammunition can be purchased in sets of 50 shots and costs 5 credits per set. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A character ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," can attempt to forage for supplies to make his or her own ammunition, requiring a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to search the area for the necessary materials. One hour and a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check can produce enough ammunition for 5 shots, and an extra 5 shots are produced for every 5 points by which the check result exceeds the DC.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1.4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
